Value Filldown VRF (\S+)
Value Required PREFIX (\S+)
Value NEXTHOP (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value VRF_EGRESS (\S+)
Value ORIGIN_TYPE (\S+)
Value DISTANCE_METRIC (\[\S+\])
Value AGE (\S+)

Start
  ^VRF:\s+${VRF}
  ^${PREFIX}\s+${NEXTHOP}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${VRF_EGRESS}\s+${ORIGIN_TYPE}\s+${DISTANCE_METRIC}\s+${AGE} -> Record